---
description: >-
  Markdown emphasis in every ER label kind with markdownAlwaysOn: true, which
  draws every label as markdown (#1368): entity name, alias, attribute type,
  name and comment, relationship label and subgraph title; an underscore inside
  a word stays. By default only a markdown string reads markdown.
config:
  markdownAlwaysOn: true
---
erDiagram
  "This **is** _Markdown_" {
    string name
  }
  P["*Alias*"] {
    **bold** _it_ PK "a __comment__"
    int order_item
  }
  subgraph Sales ["Sales **domain**"]
    order_item
  end
  P ||--o{ order_item : "__rel__"
